OL,3,AElon Musk's millions failed to deliver
OL,4,ARepublican wins in fierce midterms
OL,5,
OL,6,FElon Musk spent almost $450m (#334m) `
OL,7,Fmore than anyone ever has in an
OL,8,Felection cycle ` to back Republican
OL,9,Fpolitical candidates in the US midterm
OL,10,Fraces. It was not enough to keep
OL,11,FDemocrats from a resounding victory.
OL,13,FAmong the most striking wins went to
OL,14,FDemocrat James Talarico, who beat
OL,15,FRepublican Ken Paxton for a US Senate
OL,16,Fseat in Texas. Musk spent at least $45m
OL,17,Fin support of Paxton, according to a
OL,18,FBBC analysis of campaign finance data.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
