OL,3,AFleabag star offers rent-free flat to
OL,4,Anew writers
OL,5,
OL,6,FFleabag creator, writer and actress
OL,7,FPhoebe Waller-Bridge is offering a
OL,8,Frent-free flat in London for writers
OL,9,Fearly in their careers.
OL,11,FThe 41-year-old has bought and donated
OL,12,Fthe flat as part of a new theatre
OL,13,Finitiative Writers' Block, which aims
OL,14,Fto address the cost of London
OL,15,Faccommodation for playwrights from
OL,16,Funderprivileged backgrounds.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
